    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "2 Knocknarea Road. Drimnagh, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, take great pride presenting new to the market no.2 Knocknarea Road. This fine 2 bed 1 bath semi detached property comes to the market in great condition, ideal for first time buyers or investors alike.\r\n\r\nLocated in the very heart of Drimnagh, this property has everything you need in terms of local amenities. To include several shops, cafes, schools and parks as well as being in close proximity to Rialto and Crumlin Village.\r\n\r\nUpon entering you are met with a bright and open entrance hallway. Off this you enter a cosy front reception room which would make a nice and quiet relaxing space. Moving through the set of classic French doors you enter a second spacious reception room. Towards the rear of the property you have an extended kitchen which has a real modern feel and comes fully equipped with everything you need. Downstairs also comprises a fully tiled family bathroom.\r\n\r\nTo the rear you have a good sized and sunny back garden which has a convenient wooden shed.\r\n\r\nUpstairs you have a double bedroom alongside a bathroom to the rear and a larger double bedroom fitted with bespoke fitted wardrobes to the front aspect.\r\n\r\nNumber 2 benefits from great public transport links with several bus routes as well as the Drimnagh Red Luas stop only being a short 10 minute walk away providing easy access to the City Centre. The M50 and N7 motorways are also only a short drive away which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties.\r\n\r\nThis property will be popular so early viewing is recommended.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\r\n- Off street parking\r\n- Side entrance\r\n- Prime location\r\n- Extended"
      },
      {
